<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">heb</book>
  <para style="h">Heburune Sora</para>
  <para style="toc1">Alaa Falan Naxan Nasiga Heburune Ma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Heburune</para>
  <para style="mt1">Heburune</para>
  <para style="mt2">Alaa Falan Naxan Nasiga Heburune Ma</para>
  <para style="ip">Naxan yo na Kitabun yireni ito xaran a yeren ma, a luma nɛn na kanna xa alo a kawandi ramɛɛn nin. Kitabun yireni ito sɛbɛxi nɛn alo kawandi ba daxin na. Kitabun yireni ito raɲanna a yitama a sɛbɛxi muxune nan ma. A mɔn mi a sɛbɛ muxun fan mayitaxi. Yanyina nde, Kitabun yireni ito sɛbɛxi Romi kaane nan ma (13.24). Feen naxan kolonxi Kitabun yireni ito sɛbɛ muxuna fe yi, Yahudiyan na a ra naxan dɛnkɛlɛyaxi Marigi Yesu ma. Muxun naxan a sɛbɛxi, a Tawureta nun Yaburi Kitabun yirene kolonxi ki faɲi. A Kitabun yireni ito sɛbɛxi Yahudiya gbɛtɛye ma naxanye fan bata yi dɛnkɛlɛya Yesu ma alo a tan. Koni, e to ɲaxankataxi Yesu xinla fe ra, e xɛtɛmatɔɔn na a ra Yahudiya dinan ma. E yi e mɛma nɛn dɛnkɛlɛyaan na Yesu ma. Kitabun sɛbɛ muxuna e kawandima nɛn a e xa e sɛnbɛ so e dɛnkɛlɛyani, a yi Alaa Muxu Sugandixin fisamantenyaan mayita alogo e nama xɛtɛ e namun fonne ma. Yanyina nde Kitabun yireni ito sɛbɛ nɛn ɲɛɛ tonge saxan Yesu keli xanbi sayani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabun yireni ito yitaxunxi yire dɔxɔ firin nan na. A yire singena (1.1-10.18) Alaa Muxu Sugandixina fisamantenyana feen nan falama. Fa fala a dangu nabine ra (1.1-3), a mɔn dangu malekane ra (1.4-2.18), a dangu Nabi Musa nun Yosuwe ra (3.1-4.13); a tan nan keden findixi habadan saraxan na, a gbo dangu Layiri Fonne saraxarali gbeene ra (4.14-7.28); a saraxa kamalixin baxi nɛn naxan ba sanɲa ma keden pe a muxune rakisi han habadan, a dangu Layiri Fonna saraxa wuyaxine birin na (8.1-10.18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabun yire firindena (10.19-13.19) na muxune sɛnbɛ soma alogo e xa lu dɛnkɛlɛyani (10.19-39) e nama xɛtɛ dina gbɛtɛ ma. En misali kɛndɛne toma mɛnna nin lan Layiri Fonna dɛnkɛlɛya muxune ma (Sora 11), a mɔn a falama dɛnkɛlɛya muxune yɛɛn xa lu tixi Alaa Muxu Sugandixin na, e yi nɔɔn sɔtɔ alo a tan (12.1-11). A yelin xanbini yamarina nde fiyɛ e ma e nun a yi e kawandi (12.12-13.19), Kitabun sɛbɛ muxun a raɲanma duba tiin nan ma e nun xɔntɔnne (13.20-25).</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabun sɛbɛ muxun mi danma fala ɲaxumɛne xan tun ma alogo a xa a Kitabun xaran muxune mali e tunnaxɔlɛni. A a yɛbama e xa a dɛnkɛlɛya muxune tɔrɔma dunuɲa ayi, a mɔn yi Alaa Muxu Sugandixina wanla xunna fala. Fa fala a faxan bata kisi feen nakamali saraxa yo mi yi nɔɛ naxan nakamalɛ. Nayi, a muxune mafanma e xa lu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin fɔxɔ ra. En fan lan en Habadan Alaa Muxu Sugandixi fisamantenna xuiin suxu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu gbo malekane xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1"/>Waxati danguxini, Ala falan ti nɛn en benbane xa nabine xɔn sanɲa ma wuyaxi nun ki wuyaxi yi. <verse eid="HEB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2"/>Koni a falan tixi en tan xa waxati raɲanni ito nin a Dii Xɛmɛn xɔn. A bata daala birin sa a Dii Xɛmɛn sagoni alo a kɛɛna. A dunuɲa daxi a tan nan baraka yi. <verse eid="HEB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3"/>Alaa Dii Xɛmɛn findixi a binyen nɔrɔn nan na. Ala maligan yɛtɛɛn nan a ra. A dunuɲa yisuxi a falan sɛnbɛn nan na. A to yelin yulubi xafarin nakamalɛ, a yi dɔxɔ Ala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna yiifanna ma ariyanna yi.<verse eid="HEB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4"/>Alaa Dii Xɛmɛn tiden yi gbo ayi dangu malekane ra, a yi xinla fi a ma naxan dangu e xinle ra. <verse eid="HEB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5"/>Bayo, Ala mi a falaxi a maleka yo xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">“N ma dii xɛmɛn nan i tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">n bata findi i fafe ra to.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.5</char> Yaburin 2.7</note>”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">A mɔn mi a fala maleka yo xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">“N findima nɛn i fafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">i fan yi findi n ma dii xɛmɛn na.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.5</char> Samuyɛli Firinden 7.14</note>”<verse eid="HEB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6"/>Ala to a diin nafa dunuɲa yi alo dii singena, a mɔn naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:6">“Alaa malekane birin xa a batu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.6</char> Sariyane 32.43</note>”<verse eid="HEB 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7"/>A mɔn yi a fala malekane fe yi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:7">“Alaa malekane luma nɛn alo foyena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:7">a walikɛne yi lu alo tɛɛ dɛgɛna.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.7</char> Yaburin 104.4</note>”<verse eid="HEB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8"/>Koni a mɔn yi a fala a dii xɛmɛna fe yi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">“Ala, i luma nɛn i ya mangaya gbɛdɛni habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">I ya manga dunganna yi findi tinxinyaan taxamasenna ra.<verse eid="HEB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9"/>Tinxinna rafan i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">fe ɲaxin mi rafan i ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">Nanara, Ala, i ya Ala bata i rafisa i bodene xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">a sɛwa turen sa i xunni i sugandi feen na.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.8-9</char> Yaburin 45.7-8</note><verse eid="HEB 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10"/>A mɔn naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">“Marigina, i bɔxɔ xɔnna da nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">xabu a fɔlɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">I yii fɔxɔn nan kore xɔnna ra.<verse eid="HEB 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11"/>Ne birin danguma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:11">koni i tan luma nɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:11">Ne birin forima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:11">e kala alo dugina.<verse eid="HEB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12"/>I yi e yisa alo domana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">e yi masara alo dugina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">koni i tan luma nɛn i kiini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">i siin fan dan mi na mumɛ!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.10-12</char> Yaburin 102.26-28</note><verse eid="HEB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13"/>Ala mɔn mi a fala a maleka yo xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">“Dɔxɔ n yiifanna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">han n yi i yaxune sa i sanna bun.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.13</char> Yaburin 110.1</note><verse eid="HEB 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14"/>Malekane mi findixi Alaa walikɛ totarene xan na ba, a naxanye rasigama kisi muxune malideni?<verse eid="HEB 1:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ɛ ɲɔxɔ lu kisi feen xɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1"/>Nanara, en bata feen naxanye mɛ, fɔ en xa en ɲɔxɔ lu nɛn ne xɔn alogo en nama kiraan beɲin. <verse eid="HEB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2"/>Amasɔtɔ, malekane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.2</char> Yahudiyane namunne xaranna kui, Nabi Musa Alaa sariyane sɔtɔxi <char style="fk">malekane</char> nan xɔn ma.</note> fa xɛrayaan naxanye rali en benbane ma lan sariyan ma, ne birin suxutareyaan saranma nɛn a kala muxune ra alo a daxa kii naxan yi. <verse eid="HEB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3"/>Nayi, en fa ratangama di, xa en na en mɛ kisi gbee sifani ito ra, Marigin yɛtɛɛn singe naxan nali, na xanbi ra, a ramɛ muxune fan yi a ɲɔndin yita en na? <verse eid="HEB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4"/>Ala fan e sereya baan fari sa nɛn taxamasenne nun kabanako feene nun sɛnbɛ fe sifa wuyaxi ra, a yi a Nii Sariɲanxin kɛwanle yitaxun e ra a sagoni.<verse eid="HEB 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu en nakisimana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5"/>Awa, en yire famatɔɔn naxan ma fe falama, Ala mi na luma malekane xan sago yi. <verse eid="HEB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6"/>Koni sereyani ito sɛbɛxi Kitabun yirena nde yi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">“Nanse daɲɔxɔn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">i to i yengi dɔxi a xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">Nanfera i ɲɔxɔ luxi adamadiin xɔn?<verse eid="HEB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7"/>I a daxi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:7">a nɔrɔn yi maso malekane ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:7">I binyen nun xunnayerenna fi a ma.<verse eid="HEB 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8"/>I bata seen birin lu a bun.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.8</char> Yaburin 8.5-7</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">A to seen birin luxi adamadina nɔɔn bun, Ala mi sese lu naxan mi xuru a nɔɔn bun. Hali na, iki en mi a toma fa fala seen birin muxuna nɔɔn bun ma. <verse eid="HEB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9"/>Koni en na a toma fa fala, Ala Yesu magodo nɛn waxati dungidi dangu malekane ra, alogo a xa faxa masɔtɔ Alaa hinanna xɔn muxune birin xa. Iki en na a mangayaan binyen nun a xunna kenla toma a faxana fe ra a tin naxan ma. <verse eid="HEB 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10"/>Ala naxan seen birin da a yɛtɛ xa, a yi waxi adamadi wuyaxi raso feni a binyeni. Na yi lanxi, a to en nakisimana fe rakamali a tɔrɔn xɔn.<verse eid="HEB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11"/>Bayo Yesu naxan muxune rasariɲanma e nun a naxanye rasariɲanxi, ne birin fafe keden. Nanara, Yesu mi yagima a falɛ ne ma, “Ngaxakedenne.” <verse eid="HEB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12"/>A naxa Kitabuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:12">“N na i xinla ralima nɛn ngaxakedenne ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:12">N ni i matɔxɔma nɛn yamaan yɛ.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.12</char> Yaburin 22.23</note><verse eid="HEB 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13"/>Kitabun mɔn naxa, “N nan n yigi sama Ala nin.” A mɔn naxa, “Nxu nun n ma diine nan ito ra, Ala naxanye fixi n ma.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.13</char> Esayi 8.17-18</note><verse eid="HEB 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14"/>Nayi, bayo Yesu a muxune findixi adamadiine nan na fati bɛndɛn nun wunli, Yesu fan yɛtɛɛn bata lu alo e tan. Na ma, a yi Yinna Manga Setana halagi a yɛtɛna sayaan xɔn ma sɛnbɛn yi naxan yii sayaan xun na. <verse eid="HEB 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15"/>A na ligaxi nɛn alogo naxanye yi sayaan gaxun konyiyani e dunuɲa yi gidini, a xa ne xɔrɔya. <verse eid="HEB 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16"/>Amasɔtɔ a mi faxi malekane xan malideyi, koni fɔ Iburahima bɔnsɔnne. <verse eid="HEB 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17"/>Na nan a liga, a yi lu alo a ngaxakedenne feen birin yi, alogo a xa nɔ saraxarali kuntigiyaan wanla kɛ Ala xa kininkininna nun tɔgɔndiyani, a yi Ala solona yamaan yulubine xafari feen na. <verse eid="HEB 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18"/>Bayo Setana kataxi a xa a fan natantan, a tan yɛtɛɛn yi tɔrɔ na feni, nayi, a fɛrɛna a xa, a yi muxune mali e nɛma e ratantan feene dɛ waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="HEB 2:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu dangu Nabi Musa ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1"/>Nanara, ngaxakeden muxu rasariɲanxine, Ala bata ɛ tan naxanye xili, ɛ xaxili lu Yesu a fe xɔn, Alaa Xɛraan nun Saraxarali Kuntigi Singena, en naxan ma fe falama yamani. <verse eid="HEB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2"/>Muxu tɔgɔndiyaxin nan yi a ra Ala xa, naxan a sugandixi alo Musa yi kii naxan yi Alaa banxin birin yi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.2</char> A mato Yatɛne 12.7 kui.</note> <verse eid="HEB 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3"/>Banxi tiina xunna kenla gbo dangu banxin yɛtɛɛn na. Nanara, Yesu a xunna kenla gbo Musaa xunna kenla xa. <verse eid="HEB 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4"/>Awa, muxune nan banxine tima, koni Ala nan seen birin daxi. <verse eid="HEB 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5"/>Musa tan tɔgɔndiya nɛn wali kɛdeni Ala xa a banxin mumɛni, a sereyaan ba lan na feene ma Ala yi fama naxanye ligadeni. <verse eid="HEB 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6"/>Koni Alaa Muxu Sugandixin tan luxi na alo Alaa Dii Xɛmɛn naxan a banxin xun na. En findixi a banxin nan na, xa en na en wɛkilɛ, en yi en ma yigin namara en naxan matɔxɔma.<verse eid="HEB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Matabuna Alaa yamaan xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7"/>Nayi, alo Alaa Nii Sariɲanxina a falaxi kii naxan yi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:7">“Xa ɛ Ala fala xuiin mɛ to,<verse eid="HEB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8"/>ɛ nama ɛ bɔɲɛni xɔdɔxɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">alo ɛ yi murutɛxi Ala ma waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">ɛ yi matoon xun ti Ala ra tonbonni.<verse eid="HEB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9"/>Ɛ benbane n bunba nɛn mɛnni, e yi n matandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:9">hali e to n kɛwanle birin to ɲɛɛ tonge naanin.<verse eid="HEB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10"/>Nayi, n xɔlɔ nɛn na waxatin muxune ma, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">‘E bɔɲɛn makuya n na waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">e mi n ma kiraan xɔn.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11"/>N yi n kɔlɔ n ma xɔlɔni, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:11">‘E mi soɛ n ma matabudeni mumɛ!’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.7-11</char> Yaburin 95.7-11</note><verse eid="HEB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12"/>Ngaxakedenne, ɛ a liga ɛ yeren ma, bɔɲɛ ɲaxin nun dɛnkɛlɛyatareyaan nama lu ɛ sese yi naxan a ligɛ ɛ xɛtɛ habadan Ala fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="HEB 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13"/>Koni ɛ bode ralimaniya lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ, fanni en mɔn na waxatini Kitabun naxan ma fa fala “To” alogo ɛ tan nde nama tantan yulubin xɔn, ɛ tengbesenɲɛ ayi. <verse eid="HEB 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14"/>Amasɔtɔ en bata findi Alaa Muxu Sugandixin gbeene ra, xa en lu en ma tɔgɔndiyaan singeni, han a raɲanna.<verse eid="HEB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15"/>Kitabun naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">“Xa ɛ Ala fala xuiin mɛ to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">ɛ nama ɛ bɔɲɛni xɔdɔxɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">alo ɛ yi murutɛxi Ala ma waxatin naxan yi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.15</char> Yaburin 95.7-8</note><verse eid="HEB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16"/>Awa, ndee yi ne ra, naxanye Alaa falan mɛ, e murutɛ a xili ma? Ne findixi muxune nan na Musa naxanye ramini Misiran yamanani. <verse eid="HEB 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17"/>Ala xɔlɔ ndee ma ɲɛɛ tonge naanin? Naxanye yulubin liga, e faxa tonbonni. <verse eid="HEB 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18"/>Ala a kɔlɔ ndee a fe ra, a e mi soɛ a matabu yireni? Naxanye tondi a falan suxɛ, a yi falan tima ne nan ma fe yi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.18</char> A mato Yatɛne 14.1-35 nun Yaburin 95.11 kui.</note> <verse eid="HEB 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19"/>En bata a to nayi, fa fala e mi yi nɔɛ soɛ matabudeni lan e dɛnkɛlɛyatareyaan ma.<verse eid="HEB 3:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4"/>
  <para style="s">Matabudena Alaa muxune xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1"/>Nayi, Ala to en tuli sa, a en nɔɛ soɛ nɛn a matabudeni, en na a liga en yeren ma nayi alogo ɛ tan nde nama lu alo ɛ fulaxi na ra. <verse eid="HEB 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2"/>Bayo Alaa falan Xibaru Faɲin nali nɛn en fan ma alo na waxati danguxin muxune. Koni e falan naxan mɛ, na tɔnɔ yo mi lu e tan ma, amasɔtɔ naxanye a ramɛ, ne mi a suxu dɛnkɛlɛyani. <verse eid="HEB 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3"/>En tan naxanye dɛnkɛlɛyaxi, en tan soma nɛn na matabudeni alo Ala a fala kii naxan yi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">“N bata n kɔlɔ n ma xɔlɔni, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">‘E mi soɛ n ma matabudeni mumɛ!’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.1</char> Yaburin 95.11</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Anu, Alaa wanla bata yi kamali xabu dunuɲa da waxatini. <verse eid="HEB 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4"/>Amasɔtɔ ito falaxi Kitabun yirena nde yi xii soloferedena fe yi, a naxa, “Ala yi a matabu a wali kɛɛn xii soloferede lɔxɔni.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.4</char> Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 2.2</note> <verse eid="HEB 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5"/>A mɔn naxa Kitabun yireni ito yi, “E mi soɛ n ma matabudeni mumɛ!” <verse eid="HEB 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6"/>Na bunna nɛɛn fa fala ndee gbɛtɛye soɛ nɛn, ba muxune ra naxanye singe Alaa falan Xibaru Faɲin mɛ, e mi so lan e fala suxutareyaan ma. <verse eid="HEB 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7"/>Nanara, waxati xunkuye to dangu, Ala mɔn yi lɔxɔ nɛnɛn sa, a yi na feen fala Dawuda a Kitabun kui, a yi na lɔxɔ nɛnɛn xili sa fa fala “To.” A naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:7">“Xa ɛ Ala fala xuiin mɛ to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:7">ɛ nama ɛ bɔɲɛni xɔdɔxɔ.”<verse eid="HEB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8"/>Awa, xa Yosuwe bata yi yamaan naso Alaa matabudeni nun, Ala mi yi lɔxɔ gbɛtɛ a fe falɛ na xanbi ra. <verse eid="HEB 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9"/>Na bunna nɛɛn fa fala matabuden mɔn Alaa yamaan xa yɛɛn na. <verse eid="HEB 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10"/>Amasɔtɔ muxu yo so Alaa matabudeni, na fan a matabuma nɛn alo Ala a matabuxi kii naxan yi. <verse eid="HEB 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11"/>Na ma, en kata en so matabudeni, alogo muxu yo nama findi fala suxutaren na alo en benbane.<verse eid="HEB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12"/>Amasɔtɔ Alaa falana, niiramaan na a ra, a sɛnbɛn gbo, a dɛɛn xanxan dangu silanfanna dɛ firin kanna ra.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.12</char> <char style="fk">Silanfanna:</char> Sofane yɛngɛso dɛgɛmana.</note> A soma nɛn han a sɔndɔmɛn nun niin yɛtɛɛn fata, e nun fatin nadɔxɔdene nun fasane. A muxun miriyane nun a natane makitima nɛn. <verse eid="HEB 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13"/>Ala dali se yo mi luxunxi a ma. Ala feen birin toma. En birin en dɛntɛgɛma nɛn a xa.<verse eid="HEB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Saraxarali kuntigin nan Yesu ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14"/>Nanara, bayo saraxarali kuntigi gbeena en yii naxan kelixi kore, Yesu Alaa Dii Xɛmɛna, nayi en na en sɔbɛ so en ma dɛnkɛlɛyani, en naxan ma fe falama yamani. <verse eid="HEB 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15"/>Amasɔtɔ en ma saraxarali kuntigina en ma fangatareyaan kolon, bayo Setana kata nɛn a fan natantandeni kiin birin yi alo en tan, anu, a mi yulubi yo liga. <verse eid="HEB 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16"/>Nanara, en na en maso Ala hinantenna manga gbɛdɛn na xaxili ragidini alogo en xa kininkininna nun hinanna sɔtɔ en makoon naxanye ma.<verse eid="HEB 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nan en ma saraxarali kuntigin na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1"/>Saraxarali kuntigine birin sugandima nɛn adamadiine yɛ, alogo e xa wali Ala xa, e yi kise ralixine nun saraxane ba yulubi xafarin na. <verse eid="HEB 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2"/>E nɔɛ xaxilitarene nun muxu tantanxine famunɲɛ nɛn, bayo e tan fan yɛtɛɛn tantanma. <verse eid="HEB 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3"/>E yulubi xafari saraxane bama e tan yɛtɛna fe ra na nan ma, e nun yamaan xa. <verse eid="HEB 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4"/>Muxu yo mi saraxarali kuntigiyaan xunna kenla fenɲɛ a yɛtɛ xa. Ala nan a xilixi alo a Haruna xili kii naxan yi.<verse eid="HEB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5"/>A na kii nin, Alaa Muxu Sugandixin mi saraxarali kuntigi binyen sɔtɔ a yɛtɛ ra, koni Ala a fala nɛn a xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:5">“N ma dii xɛmɛn nan i tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:5">n bata findi i fafe ra to.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.5</char> Yaburin 2.7</note><verse eid="HEB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6"/>A mɔn yi a fala Kitabun yire gbɛtɛ yi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">“Saraxaraliin nan i ra habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">alo Mɛlikisedeki yi kii naxan yi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.6</char> Yaburin 110.4</note><verse eid="HEB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7"/>Yesu yi dunuɲa yi waxatin naxan yi, a yi Ala maxandima, a xuini te, a yɛɛgen yi mini, a yi Ala mafan naxan yi nɔɛ a rakisɛ sayaan ma. Ala yi a xuiin namɛ bayo a yi xuruxi a ma. <verse eid="HEB 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8"/>Koni hali Alaa Dii Xɛmɛn to a ra, a a xaran nɛn fala suxun ma a tɔrɔne yi. <verse eid="HEB 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9"/>Yesu a fe kamali waxatin naxan yi, a yi findi habadan Marakisi Tiin na muxune xa naxanye birin a xuiin suxuma. <verse eid="HEB 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10"/>Ala yi a findi saraxarali kuntigin na alo Mɛlikisedeki yi kii naxan yi.<verse eid="HEB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sɛnbɛ soon dɛnkɛlɛyani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11"/>Fe wuyaxi nxu kui a fala daxin na ɛ xa lan feni ito ma, koni a yɛba raxɔlɔ ɛ xa, bayo ɛ mi a famuma xulɛn. <verse eid="HEB 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12"/>A yi lan nun ɛ yi findi karamɔxɔne ra waxatini ito yi, anu han iki ɛ makoon mɔn ɛ xaran muxun ma lan Alaa falan fe singene ma. Ɛ luxi alo dii ɲɔrɛn naxan mɔn xiɲɛn na bayo ɛ mi donse xɔdɛxɛn donɲɛ singen. <verse eid="HEB 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13"/>Muxun naxan mɔn xiɲɛ minni, dii ɲɔrɛn nan na ra. A mi xaranna kolon lan tinxinyaan ma. <verse eid="HEB 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14"/>Koni fonne nan gbee donse xɔdɛxɛn na. Naxanye dɛnkɛlɛya bata kɔxɔ, ne bata e yɛtɛ xaran fe faɲin nun a ɲaxin tagi rabaan ma.<verse eid="HEB 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1"/>Nanara, en dangu Alaa Muxu Sugandixina xaranna fe singene ra, en siga yɛɛn na, hali en nama fa xɛtɛ fe fɔlɔne ma sɔnɔn alo itoe: en na en xun xanbi so fena wali ɲaxine yi naxanye muxun xalima yahannama, e nun dɛnkɛlɛyana Ala ma, <verse eid="HEB 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2"/>e nun xaranna muxu rafu feene ma igeni e tubi xinla ma e nun yii saan muxune ma Ala maxandini e nun faxa muxune rakenla sayani e nun habadan kitina. <verse eid="HEB 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3"/>Xa Ala tin, en sigɛ nɛn yɛɛn na.<verse eid="HEB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4"/>Amasɔtɔ naxanye bata yi kɛnɛnna sɔtɔ sanɲa ma keden, e Ala kisin sɔtɔ, e yi Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin sɔtɔ, <verse eid="HEB 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5"/>naxanye bata yi Alaa falan ɲaxunna kolon e nun waxati famatɔɔn sɛnbɛne, <verse eid="HEB 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6"/>ne na ba dɛnkɛlɛyani, e mi fa nɔɛ raxɛtɛ sɔnɔn, e mɔn yi tubi. Amasɔtɔ ne luxi nɛn alo e mɔn Alaa Dii Xɛmɛn nan gbangbanma wudin ma, e yi a rayarabi yamaan yɛtagi.<verse eid="HEB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7"/>A misaala, bɔxɔn naxan tule igen sɔtɔma waxatin birin, a si seene sabati a kanna xa, Alaa barakan nan na ra. <verse eid="HEB 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8"/>Koni bɔxɔn naxan ɲanle nun tansinne tunna raminima, na tɔnɔ mi na, a masoxi Alaa dangan nan na. A raɲanni, tɛɛn yi a gan.<verse eid="HEB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9"/>Koni n xanuntenne, hali nxu falan tima na kiini, nxu laxi a ra, a fe gbɛtɛ nan ɛ tan yɛɛ ra lan ɛ kisi feen ma. <verse eid="HEB 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10"/>Bayo tinxintare mi Ala ra. A mi ɲinanma ɛ wanle xɔn, e nun ɛ xanuntenyaan naxan yitaxi a ra ɛ to a yama sariɲanxin malima han iki. <verse eid="HEB 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11"/>Nxu waxi a xɔn ma, ɛ keden kedenna birin xa lu na tunnafanni han a raɲanna alogo ɛ yengi seen naxanye ma, ɛ ne sɔtɔ. <verse eid="HEB 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12"/>Nxu mi waxi, ɛ xa tunnaxɔlɔ ayi. Koni fɔ ɛ xa na dɛnkɛlɛya muxune raliga naxanye diɲa alogo Ala ɛ tuli saxi naxan na, ɛ na sɔtɔ.<verse eid="HEB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alaa layirina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13"/>Ala Iburahima tuli sa waxatin naxan yi, a yi a kɔlɔ a yɛtɛ yi, bayo muxe mi na a kɔlɔɛ naxan yi naxan gbo a tan xa. <verse eid="HEB 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14"/>A yi a fala, a naxa, “N na i barakama nɛn han! I bɔnsɔnna wuyama ayi nɛn.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">6.14</char> A mato Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 22.16-17 kui.</note> <verse eid="HEB 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15"/>Iburahima yi diɲa, a yi a legeden, Ala a tuli sa naxan na, a yi na sɔtɔ. <verse eid="HEB 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16"/>Adamadiine e kɔlɔma fena nde yi naxan gbo e tan xa, e kɔlɔn yi e falan sɛnbɛ so alogo muxune nama e matandi. <verse eid="HEB 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17"/>Nanara, Ala yi Iburahima tuli sa, a yi a kɔlɔ alogo naxanye yi lan e na feen sɔtɔ, ne xa a kolon a na fe ragidixin mi masarama. <verse eid="HEB 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18"/>Ala na liga nɛn alogo en tan naxanye a falan findixi en yigin na en xaxili tixi naxan na, en xa limaniya ki faɲi, a to na yitaxi en na fe firinna xɔn, naxanye mi maxɛtɛ, Ala mɔn mi wulen falɛ. <verse eid="HEB 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19"/>Na yigina en yii alo kunkin balana a rati seen na igen bun ma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">6.19</char> <char style="fk">Kunkin balani</char> ito findixi wure gbee kɔnkɔrɔnxina nde nan na naxan xidima kunkin ma yɔlɔnxɔnna ra. A wolima igeni alogo a xa sa digi gɛmɛna nde ra igen bun ma, a kunkin naxara. Yireni ito niin gbee maraxara seen misalixi na kunki raxara seen nan ma.</note> naxan sigama han yire sariɲanxin yɛ masansan dugin xanbi ra en niin nasuxu seen na barakani <verse eid="HEB 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20"/>Yesu singe soxi en xa dɛnaxan yi, bayo a bata findi habadan saraxarali kuntigin na, a lu alo Mɛlikisedeki.<verse eid="HEB 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7"/>
  <para style="s">Mɛlikisedeki saraxaraliyani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1"/>Mɛlikisedeki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">7.1</char> <char style="fk">Mɛlikisedeki</char> a feen mato Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 14.17-20 kui.</note> nan yi Salemi mangan na e nun Kore Xɔnna Alaa saraxaralina. Iburahima yi kelima yɛngɛni waxatin naxan yi, a mangane nɔ naxan yi, Mɛlikisedeki yi siga a ralandeni, a yi duba a xa. <verse eid="HEB 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2"/>Iburahima yi a se tongoxine birin yaganna so a yii. Mɛlikisedeki xinla bunna nɛɛn “Tinxin Mangana.” Salemi mangan nan mɔn yi a ra nun, na fan bunna nɛɛn “Bɔɲɛ Xunbeli Mangana.” <verse eid="HEB 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3"/>A baba mi kolon, a nga mi kolon, a xabila mi kolon, a siimayaan fɔlɔn nun a raɲanna mi kolon. A luxi nɛn alo Alaa Dii Xɛmɛna naxan luma saraxaraliyani habadan.<verse eid="HEB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4"/>Ɛ a gbo kii mato, hali en benba Iburahima yɛtɛɛn seen naxanye tongo yɛngɛni, a ne yaganna so a tan nan yii. <verse eid="HEB 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5"/>Sariyan naxa, a Isirayila yamaan bɔnsɔnne lan e xa yaganna so Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune nan yii, saraxaraline.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">7.5</char> A mato Yatɛne 18.21 kui.</note> Anu, ngaxakedenmane nan e ra, e birin minixi Iburahima bɔnsɔnna nin. <verse eid="HEB 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6"/>Mɛlikisedeki tan mi yi findixi Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxu ra, koni a yaganna sɔtɔ nɛn Iburahima ra, Ala naxan tuli sa. Mɛlikisedeki yi duba a xa. <verse eid="HEB 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7"/>Anu, matandi mi naxan na, naxan duban tima, na dangu duba sɔtɔn na. <verse eid="HEB 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8"/>Lewi muxun naxanye yaganne rasuxu, ne faxama nɛn, koni Mɛlikisedeki tan mabinni, Kitabun naxa a na mi faxaxi. <verse eid="HEB 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9"/>Na kui a luxi alo Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxun naxanye yaganna rasuxuma, hali ne fan yaganna ba nɛn Mɛlikisedeki xa Iburahima sabun na. <verse eid="HEB 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10"/>Bayo Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune mɔn yi e benba Iburahima fatini, a naralan Mɛlikisedeki ra waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="HEB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11"/>Xa feene yi nɔɛ rakamalɛ Lewi bɔnsɔnna saraxaraliyaan barakani nun, yamaan sariyan sɔtɔ naxan xɔn, e makoon mi yi birama saraxaraliya gbɛtɛ ma na xanbi ra nun naxan luxi alo Mɛlikisedeki hali ba Haruna bɔnsɔnne ra. <verse eid="HEB 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12"/>Bayo saraxaraliyaan na masara, fɔ sariyan fan xa masara. <verse eid="HEB 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13"/>Feni itoe fala Yesu naxan ma fe ra, na barixi bɔnsɔn gbɛtɛni, saraxaraliin munma yi mini bɔnsɔnna naxan yi. <verse eid="HEB 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14"/>A kolonxi nayi fa fala en Marigin barixi Yuda bɔnsɔnna nin. Awa, Musa saraxarali feen fala waxatin naxan yi, a mi na bɔnsɔnna fe fala.<verse eid="HEB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Saraxarali gbɛtɛ alo Mɛlikisedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15"/>Feni ito fixama nɛn dangu na ra xa saraxarali gbɛtɛ fa naxan luxi alo Mɛlikisedeki <verse eid="HEB 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16"/>naxan mi findixi saraxaraliin na sariyan xɔn a benbane fe ra, koni a findixi saraxaraliin na a faxatareyaan nan sɛnbɛ xɔn. <verse eid="HEB 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17"/>Amasɔtɔ Kitabun bata a fala, a naxa, “Saraxaraliin nan i ra habadan, alo Mɛlikisedeki yi kii naxan yi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">7.17</char> Yaburin 110.4</note>” <verse eid="HEB 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18"/>Awa, yamari fonna bata ba na a sɛnbɛtareyana fe ra, a tɔnɔ to mi yi na. <verse eid="HEB 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19"/>Bayo sariyan mi sese rakamalixi. Koni yigi fisamantenna bata mini, en na en masoma Ala ra naxan baraka yi.<verse eid="HEB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20"/>Na fe nɛnɛn mi tixi kɔlɔn xanbi. Bonne findi saraxaraline ra waxatin naxan yi, na kɔlɔ sifan mi ti. <verse eid="HEB 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21"/>Koni Yesu findixi saraxaraliin na kɔlɔn nan xɔn, Ala a fala a xa waxatin naxan yi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">“Marigin bata a kɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">a mi a xuiin maxɛtɛma, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">‘Saraxaraliin nan i ra habadan.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">7.21</char> Yaburin 110.4</note><verse eid="HEB 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22"/>Kɔlɔni ito bata Yesu findi layirin xui kɛndɛn na en tan xa.<verse eid="HEB 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23"/>Saraxarali singene yi wuya bayo e yi faxama, <verse eid="HEB 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24"/>koni Yesu tan luun nɛn habadan. A saraxaraliyaan fan luma nɛn habadan. <verse eid="HEB 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25"/>Nayi, a nɔɛ muxune rakisɛ nɛn yati naxanye fama Ala ma Yesu barakani amasɔtɔ a tan luma nɛn habadan Ala solona fe nan na.<verse eid="HEB 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26"/>En makoon yi na saraxarali kuntigi sifan nan ma: naxan sariɲan, a mi fe ɲaxi rabama, fɛ mi naxan na, naxan mi yulubi kanne yɛ, naxan yitexi kore xɔnna ma. <verse eid="HEB 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27"/>A tan mi ligaxi alo saraxarali kuntigin bonne, amasɔtɔ ne saraxan bama lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ e yɛtɛ yulubine fe ra e nun yamaan yulubine fe ra. Koni Yesu tan a yɛtɛ ba nɛn saraxan na yamaan yulubine fe ra sanɲa ma keden pe han habadan. <verse eid="HEB 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28"/>Musaa sariyan yi adamadi sɛnbɛtarene nan dɔxɔma saraxarali kuntigine ra, koni Ala a kɔlɔ falan naxan ma sariyan xanbi ra, na a Dii Xɛmɛn nan dɔxɔma naxan bata yelin kamalɛ han habadan.<verse eid="HEB 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nan en ma saraxarali kuntigin na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1"/>En ma falan birin xunna nan ito ra: En ma Saraxarali Kuntigin dɔxi Alaa Mangaya gbɛdɛn yiifanna ma ariyanna yi. <verse eid="HEB 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2"/>A walima yire sariɲanxin yɛtɛni, Marigina a yɛtɛ batuden naxan tixi, adamadiine mi naxan ti.<verse eid="HEB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3"/>Saraxarali kuntigin birin dɔxi nɛn alogo e xa kiseene nun saraxane rali Ala ma, nayi fɔ sena nde xa lu a fan yii a naxan bɛ saraxan na. <verse eid="HEB 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4"/>Xa a yi dunuɲani nun, a mi yi findima saraxaraliin na nun, amasɔtɔ gbɛtɛye na naxanye Ala kiseene ralima alo sariyana a falaxi kii naxan yi. <verse eid="HEB 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5"/>Na saraxaraline walima yire sariɲanxin naxan yi, mɛn findixi ariyanna fe misaala nun a nininna nan na. Nanara, Ala Musa rakolon na ki, a to yi Ala Batu Bubun tima, a naxa, “A liga i yeren ma, i yi e rafala alo n na a misaala yitaxi i ra geyaan fari kii naxan yi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.5</char> Xɔrɔyaan 25.40</note>” <verse eid="HEB 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6"/>Koni iki, Yesu bata wanla sɔtɔ naxan fisa saraxaraliin bonne wanla xa bayo a bata fa layirin na naxan fan Layiri Fonna xa, bayo na en tuli sa feen naxanye ra, ne fan a fonna xa.<verse eid="HEB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7"/>Xa fɛ yo mi yi layiri singen na nun,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.7</char> <char style="fk">Layiri singena</char> fe mato Xɔrɔyaan 24.3-8 kui.</note> en mako mi yi fa a firinden ma nun. <verse eid="HEB 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8"/>Koni Ala yi fɛɛn to a muxune ra, a yi a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">“Marigin naxa, ‘Na waxatin fama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">n layiri nɛnɛn xidima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">nxu nun Isirayila nun Yuda yamane tagi waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="HEB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9"/>A mi ligama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">alo n layirin naxan xidi nxu nun e benbane tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">n to e yii rasuxu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">n yi e ramini Misiran yamanani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">Amasɔtɔ e mi n ma layirin suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">n fan yi e rabeɲin.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">Marigin naxa na kiini.<verse eid="HEB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10"/>Layirin ni i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">n naxan xidima nxu nun Isirayila yamaan tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">Marigin naxa iki:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">Na waxatin na dangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">n na n ma sariyane sama nɛn e xaxinli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">n yi e sɛbɛ e bɔɲɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">N findima nɛn e Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">e yi findi n ma yamaan na.<verse eid="HEB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11"/>Muxu yo mi fa a boden maxaranma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">muxu yo mi a falɛ a ngaxakedenna xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">a naxa, ‘I xa Marigin kolon,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">bayo e birin n kolonma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">keli muxudin ma han muxu gbeena.<verse eid="HEB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12"/>N diɲama nɛn e tinxintareyaan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:12">n yi e yulubine xafari.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.8-12</char> Yeremi 31.31-34</note><verse eid="HEB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13"/>Ala to na layirin xili sa a nɛnɛna, na bunna nɛɛn a nɛnɛn bata lu a fonna ɲɔxɔni. Seen naxan bata fori, na tununma nɛn.<verse eid="HEB 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu saraxana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1"/>Layiri singen kui, yamarina ndee yi na nun lan Ala batu feen nun a yire sariɲanxina fe ma dunuɲa muxune naxan tixi a xa. <verse eid="HEB 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2"/>E Ala batu bubun ti nɛn nayi. Na bubun kui singen yi xili Yire Sariɲanxina. Lɛnpune dɔxɔ seen yi na, e nun tabanla nun burun naxanye ralixi Ala ma. <verse eid="HEB 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3"/>Yɛ masansan dugin firinden xanbi ra, bubu kui gbɛtɛ yi na naxan yi xili Yire Sariɲanxi Fisamantenna, <verse eid="HEB 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4"/>e nun a wusulan saraxa gande xɛma daxina, e nun a Layiri Kankirana.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fk">9.4</char> <char style="fk">Layiri Kankirana</char> fe mɔn sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 25.10-22 kui.</note> Xɛmaan yi saxi na kankiraan birin ma. Xɛma kundidin yi na kui, Manna donseen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.4</char> <char style="fk">Manna donsena</char> a fe mato Xɔrɔyaan 16.13-15 nun 16.31 kui. Donseen nan yi a ra Ala yi naxan fima a yamaan ma tonbonni.</note> fan yi na kui. Haruna dunganna fan yi kankiraan kui naxan bata yi a maɲingi e nun gɛmɛ walaxane layirin yi sɛbɛxi naxanye ma. <verse eid="HEB 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5"/>Na Layiri Kankiraan xun ma, maleka gubugubu kan nɔrɔxine sawuran yi na. E gubugubune yi bandunxi kankiraan dɛraganla xun ma, Ala solonaden na. Koni en nama na feene birin yɛba iki.<verse eid="HEB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6"/>Feene birin to yitɔn na kiini, saraxaraline yi soma nɛn na yire singeni waxatin birin alogo e xa e wanla rakamali. <verse eid="HEB 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7"/>Koni yiren firindeni, saraxarali kuntigin nan tun keden yi soma na sanɲa ma keden ɲɛɛn bun ma. Anu, fɔ a saraxan wunla xali, a yi a rali a yɛtɛ yulubine nun yamaan yulubine xafari seen na. <verse eid="HEB 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8"/>Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin munma yi a kiraan makɛnɛn yamaan yi soma yire sariɲanxi fisamantenni naxan xɔn Ala batu bubu singen yi tixi waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="HEB 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9"/>Misaala nan na ra waxatini ito xa. Nanara, kiseene nun saraxan naxanye yi ralima Ala ma, ne mi yi nɔɛ Ala batu muxune sɔndɔmɛne sariɲanɲɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10"/>Tɔnna nan tun yi ne ra lan donseene nun min seene ma e nun fati maxana e dinan kiine ma, naxanye yi daxa han waxati nɛnɛn yi a li.<verse eid="HEB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11"/>Koni Alaa Muxu Sugandixin to fa alo saraxarali kuntigin naxan fe faɲine rafa, a danguxi Ala Batu Banxi fisamantenna nin naxan kamalixi, muxune mi naxan tixi, dunuɲa gbee mi naxan na. <verse eid="HEB 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12"/>Yesu to so Yire Sariɲanxi Fisamantenni, a mi kɔtɔn wunla xan ba saraxan na de hanma tura dina, a yɛtɛ wunla nan ba sanɲa ma keden pe, a yi en xunba habadan. <verse eid="HEB 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13"/>Amasɔtɔ kɔtɔn wunla hanma turana, e nun ɲinge gilɛ ganxin xubena, xa ne xuya muxu xɔsixine ma, na yi e fati bɛndɛn nasariɲan, <verse eid="HEB 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14"/>nayi, Alaa Muxu Sugandixin wunla sɛnbɛn gbo dangu na ra! Amasɔtɔ, a bata a yɛtɛ ba saraxa fɛtaren na Ala xa, Alaa habadan Nii Sariɲanxin barakani. Na wunla en sɔndɔmɛne sariɲanma nɛn kɛwali ɲaxine ma naxanye en faxama, en yi nɔ habadan Ala batuɛ.<verse eid="HEB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15"/>Na nan a ligaxi Yesu findixi layiri nɛnɛn sabun na alogo Ala naxanye xilixi, ne xa nɔ habadan kɛɛn sɔtɛ, a e tuli sa naxan na. A faxa na nan ma, a findi e xunba seen na yulubine yi naxanye ligaxi na layiri singen waxatini. <verse eid="HEB 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16"/>Amasɔtɔ xa layirin xidixi lan muxuna nde kɛɛ yitaxunna ma, na mi kamalɛ fɔ na kanna na faxa. <verse eid="HEB 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17"/>Kɛɛn mi taxunma fanni a kanna mɔn ɲɛɲɛ fɔ a na faxa, a layirin yi rakamali. <verse eid="HEB 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18"/>Nanara, hali layiri singen yɛtɛna, a mi fɔlɔ benun wunla xa mini. <verse eid="HEB 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19"/>Musa to yelin yamarine birin falɛ yamaan birin xa fata sariyan na, a yi turadine nun kɔtɔne wunla tongo, e nun igena, e nun yɛxɛɛ xabe gbeela, a yi wunla xuya Sariya Kitabun nun yamaan birin ma ɲɔxɔnden na naxan xili hisopina.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.19</char> <char style="fk">Hisopi</char> findixi sansi bili xurudin nan na e yulubi xafari wunla xuyama naxan na saraxabadeni. Na feen sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 12.22 kui.</note> <verse eid="HEB 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20"/>A yi a fala, a naxa, “Wunli ito nan layiri xidi seen na, Ala ɛ yamarixi naxan suxu feen ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.20</char> Xɔrɔyaan 24.3-8</note>” <verse eid="HEB 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21"/>Musa mɔn yi wunla xuya Ala Batu Bubun nun a rawali seene birin ma. <verse eid="HEB 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22"/>Sariyan kui, fayida seen birin nasariɲanxi wunla nan xɔn, anu, xa wunla mi mini, yulubin mi xafarɛ.<verse eid="HEB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu saraxan nan yulubin xafarima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23"/>A yi daxa na seene xa rasariɲan na kii nin, bayo e findixi ariyanna seene misaale nan na. Koni ariyanna seene yɛtɛɛn yi daxa e rasariɲan saraxan na naxan dangu ne ra. <verse eid="HEB 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24"/>Amasɔtɔ Alaa Muxu Sugandixin mi soxi yire sariɲanxini, muxune naxan tixi, dɛnaxan findixi ariyanna misaala gbansanna ra, koni a soxi ariyanna yɛtɛɛn nin, alogo a xa ti Ala yɛtagi en xa iki. <verse eid="HEB 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25"/>A mi soxi a yɛtɛ badeni saraxan na sanɲa ma wuyaxi alo saraxarali kuntigin soma kii naxan yi yire sariɲanxi fisamantenni ɲɛɛ yo ɲɛɛ sube wunla ra a yii. <verse eid="HEB 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26"/>Bayo xa na nan yi a ra nun, Yesu yi tɔrɔma nɛn nun sanɲa ma wuyaxi xabu dunuɲa da waxatina. Koni iki, waxati raɲanni, a bata mini kɛnɛnni sanɲa ma keden han habadan, a a yɛtɛ ba saraxan na, a yi yulubine birin ɲan. <verse eid="HEB 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27"/>Adamadiine birin faxan nɛn sanɲa ma keden pe, na xanbi ra kitin yi a li. <verse eid="HEB 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28"/>Alaa Muxu Sugandixin fan findixi saraxan na na kii nin sanɲa ma keden pe, a muxu wuyaxi yulubin ɲan. A mɔn fama nɛn, koni a mi fama yulubi xafari feen na. A fama a legeden muxune nan nakisideyi.<verse eid="HEB 9:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu saraxana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1"/>Musaa sariyan findixi fe famatɔne maligan nan na, e tan yɛtɛɛn mi a ra. Nanara, saraxan naxanye bama waxatin birin ɲɛɛ yo ɲɛɛ, ne mi nɔɛ Ala batu muxune rakamalɛ. <verse eid="HEB 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2"/>Xa e yi nɔɛ na ra nun, muxune mi yi luyɛ e bɛ waxatin birin. Bayo Ala batu muxune yi sariɲanma nɛn nun sanɲa ma keden han habadan, e mi yi fa e yɛtɛ kolonɲɛ yulubi tongon na nun. <verse eid="HEB 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3"/>Koni na ɲɛɛ yo ɲɛɛ saraxane muxune yulubine rabirama e ma nɛn. <verse eid="HEB 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4"/>Amasɔtɔ turaan wunla nun siin wunla mi nɔɛ yulubin ɲanɲɛ mumɛ!<verse eid="HEB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5"/>Na nan a ligaxi, Yesu fa dunuɲa yi waxatin naxan yi, a yi a fala Ala xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">“I mi waxi saraxane nun kiseene xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">koni i bata n fati bɛndɛni tɔn n xa.<verse eid="HEB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6"/>Saraxa gan daxine nun yulubi xafari saraxane mi rafan i ma.<verse eid="HEB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7"/>Nayi, n yi a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:7">n naxa, ‘N tan ni i ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:7">N ma fe sɛbɛxi Kitabuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:7">Ala, n bata fa i tan sagoon ligadeni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.7</char> Yaburin 40.7-9</note>’ ”<verse eid="HEB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8"/>Awa, a naxan singe fala, a naxa, “Saraxane nun kiseene nun saraxa gan daxine nun yulubi xafari saraxane mi rafan i ma.” Anu, sariyana e ba feen yamarixi. <verse eid="HEB 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9"/>Na xanbi ra, a mɔn yi a fala, a naxa, “N tan ni i ra, n bata fa i sagoon ligadeni.” Nayi, a yi saraxa singene ba na, a yi a masara a nɛnɛn na. <verse eid="HEB 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10"/>Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixina a sagoon naxan ligaxi, a yi a fati bɛndɛn ba saraxan na, na en sariɲanma nɛn sanɲa ma keden pe han habadan.<verse eid="HEB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11"/>Saraxaraline birin e wanla kɛma lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ. E saraxane bama yɛyɛ, naxanye mi nɔɛ yulubin xafarɛ mumɛ! <verse eid="HEB 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12"/>Koni Yesu tan, na saraxa keden peen nan ba yulubine fe ra, a yi dɔxɔ Ala yiifanna ma han habadan. <verse eid="HEB 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13"/>Iki a Ala mamɛma alogo a xa a yaxune lu a sanna bun ma. <verse eid="HEB 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14"/>Amasɔtɔ muxun naxanye rasariɲanma, a bata ne rakamali saraxa keden peen xɔn han habadan.<verse eid="HEB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15"/>Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin fan na feen seren bama en xa. A fala singen naxan ti, a naxa,<verse eid="HEB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16"/>“Layirin ni i ra nxu nun Isirayila kaane naxan xidima:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">Na waxatin na dangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">n nan n ma sariyane sama nɛn e bɔɲɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">n yi e sɛbɛ e xaxinla ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.16-17</char> Yeremi 31.33-34 naxan bata yi sɛbɛ nun Heburune 8.8-12 kui.</note>”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">Marigin naxa na kiini.<verse eid="HEB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17"/>A mɔn naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:17">“N mi fa n xaxili luma e yulubine</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:17">nun e sariya kala feene xɔn sɔnɔn.”<verse eid="HEB 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18"/>Anu, ne na mafelu, saraxa mi fa bama yulubina fe ra.<verse eid="HEB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">En na en tunnafan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19"/>Nayi, ngaxakedenne, en xaxili ragidixi so feen na yire sariɲanxi fisamantenna nin Yesu wunla barakani. <verse eid="HEB 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20"/>A so dɛɛn naxan nabixi en xa, kira nɛnɛn nan na ra naxan tixi nii rakisin ma, en nɔɛ sigɛ yɛ masansan dugin xanbi ra naxan xɔn, kiraan naxan findixi a fati bɛndɛn na. <verse eid="HEB 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21"/>En ma saraxarali kuntigin nan Ala Batu Banxin xunna, <verse eid="HEB 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22"/>nayi, en xa en maso Ala ra bɔɲɛ sariɲanxin nun dɛnkɛlɛya dɛfexini, en bɔɲɛn to sariɲanxi feene birin ma, en xaxinla en yalagima naxanye ma, en fati bɛndɛn to maxaxi ige sariɲanxin na. <verse eid="HEB 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23"/>En lu en tiyɛ en yigina fe ra yamani, amasɔtɔ naxan en tuli saxi, na tinxin. <verse eid="HEB 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24"/>En na en ɲɔxɔ lu en bode xɔn ma, en yi en bode rawɛkilɛ xanuntenyaan nun wali faɲi rabaan ma. <verse eid="HEB 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25"/>En nama en mɛ en ma malanne ra alo muxuna ndee darixi a ligɛ kii naxan yi. Koni en na en bode ralimaniya waxatin birin, alo en to Marigina lɔxɔn toon masoɛ.<verse eid="HEB 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26"/>En yelin xanbini ɲɔndin kolonna sɔtɛ, xa en na a rakeli a ma, en lu yulubin ligɛ, saraxa mi fa en yii sɔnɔn yulubin mafelu feen na, <verse eid="HEB 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27"/>fɔ kiti famatɔɔn nun tɛɛ gbeen gaxuna naxan Ala matandi muxune halagima. <verse eid="HEB 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28"/>Ala sariyan naxan so Musa yii, naxan yo na yi na kala, na kanna yi faxama kininkinintareyaan nin, xa muxu keden hanma firin bata sereyaan ba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.28</char> A mato Sariyane 19.15 kui.</note> <verse eid="HEB 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29"/>Awa, na kanna mi saranɲɛ a kɛwanle ra ba, naxan na Alaa Dii Xɛmɛna fe rayelefu, hanma naxan na Alaa layirin xidi wunla rafɛya naxan a sariɲanma, hanma naxan na Ala hinantenna Nii Sariɲanxin nasɔtɔ? <verse eid="HEB 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30"/>Bayo en tan a kolon naxan a falaxi, a naxa, “N tan nan gbeeɲɔxɔ tiin na, n tan nan donle saranma e yatɛne ra.” E nun mɔn, a naxa, “Marigina a yamaan makitima nɛn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.30</char> Sariyane 32.35-36</note>” <verse eid="HEB 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31"/>Gbalon na a ra xa muxun bira habadan Ala ra.<verse eid="HEB 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32"/>Na lɔxɔ singene fe xa rabira ɛ ma, ɛ Alaa kɛnɛnna sɔtɔ waxatin naxan yi. Ɛ tunnafan nɛn yɛngɛ xɔdɛxɛn nun tɔrɔyani na waxatini. <verse eid="HEB 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33"/>E yi ɛ konbima yamaan yɛtagi waxatina nde yi, e ɛ tɔrɔ. Waxati gbɛtɛ, naxanye na fe sifan sɔtɔ, ɛ kafu nɛn ne ma. <verse eid="HEB 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34"/>Ɛ yi kininkinin kasorasane ma, ɛ yi tin sɛwani muxune yi ɛ yii seene tongo, bayo ɛ yi a kolon fa fala ɛ yii se fisamantenne ramaraxi habadan. <verse eid="HEB 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35"/>Nayi, ɛ xaxili ragidixi naxan ma, ɛ nama na rabeɲin, bayo a findima nɛn kɔntɔn gbeen na ɛ xa. <verse eid="HEB 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36"/>Ɛ makoon tunnafanna ma, alogo ɛ na Ala sagoon liga, a ɛ tuli sa naxan na, ɛ yi na sɔtɔ. <verse eid="HEB 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37"/>Amasɔtɔ Kitabuna a falaxi kii naxan yi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">“A bata lu ndedi, siya di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">naxan fama, na yi fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">a mi fa buma.<verse eid="HEB 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38"/>Koni n ma tinxin muxun nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">a dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.37-38</char> Xabakuki 2.3-4</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">Anu, xa naxan xɛtɛ a xanbi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">na kanna mi n kɛnɛnɲɛ.”<verse eid="HEB 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39"/>En tan mi xɛtɛma en xanbi ra, en yi halagi, koni en luma dɛnkɛlɛyani nɛn, en niin yi kisi.<verse eid="HEB 10:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11"/>
  <para style="s">Dɛnkɛlɛyana fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1"/>En na la en yigin na, en yi xaxili ragidi feen ma en mi naxan toma, na nan dɛnkɛlɛyaan na. <verse eid="HEB 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2"/>A singe ra muxune sereya faɲin sɔtɔ e dɛnkɛlɛyaan nan xɔn.<verse eid="HEB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3"/>Dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, en na a kolon fa fala dunuɲa daxi Ala fala xuiin nan ma. Nanara, en seen naxanye toma ne mi fataxi fe toxine ra.<verse eid="HEB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4"/>Dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, Habila yi saraxan ba Ala xa naxan yi fisa Kayini gbeen xa. Ala yɛtɛɛn yi sereyaan ba a saraxana fe ma, fa fala, a tinxin muxun nan a ra. Dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, hali Habila to bata faxa, koni a mɔn falan tima.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.4</char> A mato Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 4.3-10 kui.</note><verse eid="HEB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5"/>Dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, Xenɔki yi te kore xɔnna ma, a mi faxa, a mi fa to sɔnɔn. Amasɔtɔ Ala bata yi a xali. Benun a xa xali kore, a bata yi na sereɲɔxɔyaan sɔtɔ nun fa fala a bata Ala kɛnɛn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.5</char> A mato Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 5.18-24 kui.</note> <verse eid="HEB 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6"/>Muxu yo mi Ala kɛnɛnɲɛ dɛnkɛlɛyaan xanbi, bayo naxan fama Ala ma, fɔ na xa la a ra nɛn fa fala Ala na yi, e nun muxun naxanye a fenma, Ala ne kɔntɔnna fima nɛn.<verse eid="HEB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7"/>Dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, Nuhan to rakolon fe famatɔne fe yi, a munma yi naxanye to, a yi kunkin nafala Ala yɛɛragaxun ma a tan nun a denbayaan nakisɛ naxan kui. A dɛnkɛlɛyaan yi findi dunuɲa muxun bonne yalagi xunna ra, a tan yi tinxinyaan sɔtɔ a kɛɛn na dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn.<verse eid="HEB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8"/>Dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, Ala to Iburahima xili, a yi a falan suxu, a siga na yamanani, a yi naxan sɔtɔma a kɛɛn na, hali a to mi yi a kolon a sigan dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="HEB 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9"/>Dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, Ala a tuli sa yamanan naxan na, a dɔxɔ mɛnni xɔɲɛyani. A yi lu bubune kui, alo Isiyaga nun Yaxuba fan a liga kii naxan yi, Ala naxanye fan tuli sa na kɛɛ kedenna ra. <verse eid="HEB 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10"/>Amasɔtɔ Iburahima yi taan nan mamɛma nun naxan bɛtɛn sa kii kɛndɛ, Ala naxan ma fe yitɔn, a yi a ti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.10</char> A findixi Yerusalɛn nɛnɛn nan na naxan ariyanna yi. A mato Heburune 11.16 nun 12.22 kui.</note><verse eid="HEB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11"/>Dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, Iburahima fan yi sɛnbɛn sɔtɔ a nɔ diin sɔtɛ hali a to bata yi fori, hali gbantan to yi Saran fan na, amasɔtɔ naxan bata yi a tuli sa, a yi laxi na kanna tinxinyaan na. <verse eid="HEB 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12"/>Nanara, hali faxan to bata yi maso a ra, a bɔnsɔn wuyaxi bari nɛn, naxanye yi wuya alo sarene hanma baan xɔn ɲɛmɛnsinna naxanye xasabin mi nɔɛ yatɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13"/>Na muxune birin faxa dɛnkɛlɛyaan nin. Ala e tuli sa naxanye ra, e mi ne sɔtɔ, koni e e to nɛn wulani, e sɛwa e fe ra. E yi e ti a ra fa fala a xɔɲɛn nun sigatiin nan tun e tan na dunuɲani ito yi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.13</char> A mato Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 23.4 kui.</note> <verse eid="HEB 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14"/>Naxanye falan tima na kiini, ne a yitama nɛn fa fala a e dɔxɔden nan fenma e yɛtɛ xa. <verse eid="HEB 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15"/>E keli yamanan naxan yi, xa na xɔnla yi e suxu nun, waxatina nde e yi fɛrɛn sɔtɔma nɛn e xɛtɛ na. <verse eid="HEB 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16"/>Koni e yi taa fisamantenna nan fenma, naxan findixi ariyanna ra. Nanara, na yagin mi Ala ma, e na a xili a e Ala, amasɔtɔ a bata taani tɔn e xa.<verse eid="HEB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17"/>Dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, Ala to wa Iburahima kɛɲaan fɛsɛfɛsɛ feni, Iburahima mi tondi Isiyaga bɛ saraxan na a xa. Ala naxan tuli saxi, na yi tin a dii xɛmɛ kedenna bɛ saraxan na, <verse eid="HEB 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18"/>hali Ala to bata yi a fala a xa nun, a naxa, “Naxanye yatɛma i bɔnsɔnna ra, ne minima Isiyaga bɔnsɔnna nin.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.17-18</char> A mato Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 21.12 nun 22.1-14 kui.</note> <verse eid="HEB 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19"/>Iburahima yi laxi a ra nun fa fala a Ala nɔɛ Isiyaga rakelɛ nɛn sayani. A dii xɛmɛn mɔn yi raxɛtɛ a ma, na feen yi findi taxamasenna ra.<verse eid="HEB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20"/>Dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, Isiyaga yi duba Yaxuba nun Esayu xa lan waxati famatɔne ma.<verse eid="HEB 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21"/>Dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, benun Yaxuba xa faxa, a duba nɛn Yusufu a dii xɛmɛ keden kedenne birin xa. A yi a tingilimati a dunganna xunna, a yi Ala batu.<verse eid="HEB 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22"/>Dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, benun Yusufu xa faxa waxatin naxan yi a Isirayila kaane ramini feen fala nɛn Misiran yamanani, a yamarin fi lan a binbina fe ma.<verse eid="HEB 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23"/>Dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, Musa bari waxatin naxan yi, a sɔtɔ muxune yi a luxun kike saxan, bayo e bata yi a to, a dii faɲin nan yi a ra, e mi gaxu mangana tɔnna yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="HEB 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24"/>Dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, Musa to gbo, a mi tin e xa a xili fa fala Misiran Mangana dii tɛmɛna dii xɛmɛna. <verse eid="HEB 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25"/>A yi tin a ma a e nun Alaa yamaan xa ɲaxankata e bode xɔn, benun a xa lu yulubini ɲaxunni naxan mi buma. <verse eid="HEB 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26"/>A yi rafan a ma, a xa ɲaxankata Alaa Muxu Sugandixina fe ra benun a xa Misiran yamanan nafunle sɔtɔ bayo a yɛɛn yi tixi a kɔntɔn famatɔɔn na.<verse eid="HEB 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27"/>Dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, Musa yi keli Misiran yamanani, a mi gaxu mangan xɔlɔ feen na. A yi a tunnafan alo a yi Ala totaren toma nun. <verse eid="HEB 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28"/>Dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, a yi Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.28</char> <char style="fk">Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla:</char> Musaa waxatini, Ala fitina feen nafa nɛn Firawona yamaan ma, malekan yi fa e dii singene birin faxa kɔɛ kedenna ra. Koni, Isirayila kaane yi saraxa wunla xuya e banxine dɛ wudine ma, saya malekan yi dangu e xun ma. Na feen sanla ni ito ra. A mato Xɔrɔyaan 12.1-13 kui.</note> yamarine suxu, a wunla xuya banxine dɛɛne ma alogo Halagi Ti Malekan nama Isirayila dii singene faxa.<verse eid="HEB 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29"/>Dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, Isirayila kaane yi Baa Gbeela gidi, alo e yi xaren nan na, koni Misiran kaane to kata gidideni e birin yi mamin igeni.<verse eid="HEB 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30"/>Dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, Yeriko taan nabilinna yinna yi bira, e yelin xanbini a rabilinɲɛ xii solofere. <verse eid="HEB 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31"/>Dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, yalunde ɲaxanla Raxabi mi halagi dɛnkɛlɛyatarene xɔn, amasɔtɔ a xɛrane yisuxu nɛn ki faɲi naxanye yi taan nakɔrɔsima wundoni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.31</char> A mato Yosuwe 6.12-21 kui.</note><verse eid="HEB 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32"/>N mɔn nanse falɛ? Waxati mi n yii, n Gedeyɔn ma fe fala, hanma Baraki hanma Samisɔn hanma Yefite hanma Dawuda hanma Samuyɛli hanma nabine. <verse eid="HEB 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33"/>Ne yamanane nɔ dɛnkɛlɛyaan nan xɔn. E tinxinyaan liga. Ala e tuli sa naxan na, e yi na sɔtɔ. E yi yatane dɛ xidi. <verse eid="HEB 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34"/>E tɛɛn sɛnbɛn natu. E tanga silanfanna ma,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.34</char> <char style="fk">Silanfanna:</char> Sofane yɛngɛso dɛgɛmana.</note> e sɛnbɛtareyaan yi masara sɛnbɛn na, e fangan sɔtɔ yɛngɛni, e sofa xɔɲɛne kedi. <verse eid="HEB 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35"/>Ɲaxanla ndee faxa muxune yi xɛtɛ e ma keli sayani.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.35</char> A mato Mangane Singen 17.17-24 kui.</note> Muxu gbɛtɛ yi ɲaxankataxi, koni e tondi e xunbɛ alogo e xa marakeli fisamantenna sɔtɔ sayani. <verse eid="HEB 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36"/>E yi ndee magele, e yi ndee bulan. E yi ndee xidi, e yi e sa kasoon na. <verse eid="HEB 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37"/>E yi e magɔlɔn. E yi ndee yixaba sɛraan na. E yi ndee faxa silanfanna ra. Ndee yi marabɛri baxi yɛxɛɛ xabe dugine nun sii xabe dugine nan na, e yii gelixi, e bɛsɛnxɔnyaxi, e ɲaxankataxi. <verse eid="HEB 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38"/>E yi xuyaxi ayi burunna xun xɔn geyane fari. E dɔxɔ faranne nun yinle ra. Anu, e tan nɔrɔn mi lan dunuɲa muxune yɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39"/>Na muxune birin sereya faɲin sɔtɔ e dɛnkɛlɛyaan nan xɔn, anu, Ala e tuli sa naxan na, e mi na sɔtɔ. <verse eid="HEB 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40"/>Koni Ala bata a ragidi a xa fe faɲini tɔn en xa alogo na muxune fe nama kamali en xanbi.<verse eid="HEB 11:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12"/>
  <para style="s">Ala nan en xuruma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1"/>Bayo en nabilinxi yama gbee sifani ito nan na en serene ra, nayi, en na en mɛ en yulubine nun en hakɛ goronne ra naxanye en madiganma, en yi en tunnafan xataɲɔxɔya giini naxan nagidixi en ma. <verse eid="HEB 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2"/>En na en yɛɛn ti Yesu ra, naxan dɛnkɛlɛyaan kiraan nabixi en xa e nun naxan mɔn a rakamalima. A tan naxan a mɛ sɛwan na naxan yi findɛ a gbeen na, a yi a wɛkilɛ faxan ma wudin fari, a mi na yagin yatɛ. Na xanbi ra, a yi dɔxɔ Alaa manga gbɛdɛn yiifanna ma.<verse eid="HEB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3"/>Ɛ miri Yesu ma naxan diɲa yulubi kanne bɛsɛnxɔnya gbee sifani ito bun ma alogo ɛ niin nama rafɔrɔ, ɛ yigitɛgɛ. <verse eid="HEB 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4"/>Amasɔtɔ ɛ munma yulubin yɛngɛ singe han ɛ wunla yi mini. <verse eid="HEB 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5"/>Ɛ bata ɲinan na falan na, Ala ɛ ralimaniya naxan na, a ɛ xili fa fala “A diine.” A naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">“N ma diina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">Marigin nɛma i xurɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">i nama yo na ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">A nɛma i sɔnna yitɛ i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">i bɔɲɛn nama kala.<verse eid="HEB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6"/>Amasɔtɔ Marigina a xanuntenne xuruma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:6">A naxanye birin yatɛxi a diine ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:6">a ne fe ɲaxine saranma e ra nɛn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.5-6</char> Sandane 3.11-12</note>”<verse eid="HEB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7"/>Ɛ tɔrɔne yisuxu ɛ yi, bayo Ala ɛ xuruma nɛn alo a diine. Diin mundun na naxan fafe mi a xuruma? <verse eid="HEB 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8"/>Xa Ala mi ɛ xuruma alo a lan birin ma kii naxan yi, na luxi nɛn alo ɛ mi findixi a diine ra fɔ muxu gbɛtɛna diine. <verse eid="HEB 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9"/>En birin fafane en xuruma dunuɲa yi, en yi e binya. A mi lanɲɛ nayi ba, en xuru en niin kanna ma dangu ne ra, en yi nii rakisin sɔtɔ? <verse eid="HEB 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10"/>En fafane en xuruma waxatidi tun, alo a lanxi e miriyani kii naxan yi. Koni Ala en xuruma en munanfanna nan ma, alogo en xa a sariɲanna sɔtɔ. <verse eid="HEB 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11"/>Muxun nɛma xurɛ, a mi sɛwɛ na ra bayo a xɔlɔ. Koni dɔnxɛn na, naxanye xuruxi, ne a tɔnɔn sɔtɔma nɛn bɔɲɛ xunbenla nun tinxinyani.<verse eid="HEB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xaranna nun maxadina fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12"/>Nanara, ɛ xa ɛ xadan yiine yixɔdɔxɔ, ɛ yi ɛ xinbine sɛnbɛ so ken! <verse eid="HEB 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13"/>Ɛ sigan ti kira tinxinxine nan xɔn, alogo naxanye godoma e sanna ma, ne sanna nama kala, fɔ e kɛndɛya.<verse eid="HEB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14"/>Ɛ yixɔdɔxɔ, lanna xa lu ɛ nun muxune birin tagi, ɛ mɔn yi sariɲan. Amasɔtɔ muxu yo mi Marigin toɛ sariɲanna xanbi. <verse eid="HEB 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15"/>Ɛ a liga ɛ yeren ma, muxu yo nama fula Alaa hinanna ra. Ɛ sese nama liga alo sansi salen xɔlɛn naxan solima, a yɛngɛne rakeli ɛ tagi, a ɛ wuyaxi dabari. <verse eid="HEB 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16"/>Ɛ a liga ɛ yeren ma, muxu yo nama findi yanga suxun na hanma dina rabatutarena alo Esayu naxan a foriya tiden masara donseen na. <verse eid="HEB 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17"/>Ɛ a kolon fa fala dɔnxɛn na, a wa nɛn kɛɛn duban xɔn a baba yii, koni a mi a sɔtɔ. A yi feen birin liga, koni na mi feene maxɛtɛ mumɛ, hali a to wuga.<verse eid="HEB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18"/>Ɛ mi luxi alo Isirayila kaan naxanye e maso geyaan na yiin dinɲɛ naxan na e nun tɛɛn nun dimin nun kunda yidimixin nun foyena. <verse eid="HEB 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19"/>Ɛ mi xɔta xuiin nun Ala fala xui magaxuxin mɛxi alo ne. E fala xuiin mɛ waxatin naxan yi, e yi Musa mafan, a e nama fa fala gbɛtɛ mɛ sɔnɔn. <verse eid="HEB 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20"/>Amasɔtɔ e yi gaxuxi Ala yamarin yɛɛ ra, naxan a fala, a naxa, “Naxan na a sanna ti geyaan ma, a xa magɔlɔn han a faxa hali subena.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.20-21</char> A mato Xɔrɔyaan 19.12-13 nun Sariyane 9.19 kui.</note>” <verse eid="HEB 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21"/>Na feen yi magaxu ayi han Musa yi a fala, a naxa, “N bata gaxu han n xuruxurunma.”<verse eid="HEB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22"/>Koni ɛ ɛ masoxi Siyon geyaan nan na, habadan Alaa taana, Yerusalɛn ariyanna yi. A maleka wuli wuli wuyaxi malanxi ɲaxaɲaxani. <verse eid="HEB 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23"/>Ɛ bata maso dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan na, Alaa dii singene, naxanye xili sɛbɛxi ariyanna yi. Ɛ bata maso Ala ra, muxune birin ma kitisana. Ɛ bata maso tinxin muxune ra naxanye niin sariɲan. <verse eid="HEB 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24"/>Ɛ bata maso Yesu ra naxan layiri nɛnɛni tɔnxi, a wunla yi mini, a fala ti kiin yi fisa Habila wunla gbeen xa.<verse eid="HEB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25"/>Ɛ a liga ɛ yeren ma naxan falan tima ɛ xa, ɛ nama tondi na xuiin namɛ. Amasɔtɔ Ala to Isirayila kaane rakolon dunuɲa yi, e tondi nɛn, e yi ɲaxankata. Nba, en tan kisima nayi di, xa en tondi na falan mɛ naxan fataxi ariyanna ra? <verse eid="HEB 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26"/>Na waxatini, a fala xuiin bɔxɔn naxuruxurun nɛn, koni iki a bata en tuli sa, a naxa, “N mɔn bɔxɔni maxama nɛn sanɲa ma keden e nun kore xɔnna fan.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.26</char> Xage 2.6</note>” <verse eid="HEB 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27"/>Fa fala, “sanɲa ma keden” na bunna nɛɛn, naxan yo yimaxama dunuɲa yi, a na bama nɛn alo dali seene. Naxanye mi mamaxɛ, ne yi lu.<verse eid="HEB 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28"/>Nanara, en to mangayaan sɔtɔma naxan mi mamaxɛ, en barikan bira Ala xa, en na Ala batu a tinna kui binyen nun gaxuni. <verse eid="HEB 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29"/>Amasɔtɔ en ma Ala mɔn luxi nɛn alo halagi ti tɛɛna.<verse eid="HEB 12:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13"/>
  <para style="s">En na Ala kɛnɛnma kii naxan yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1"/>Ɛ lu ngaxakedenyaan xanuntenyani. <verse eid="HEB 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2"/>Ɛ nama ɲinan xɔɲɛ yisuxun xɔn ma amasɔtɔ ndee malekane yisuxu na kii nin, hali e to mi yi a kolon. <verse eid="HEB 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3"/>Ɛ ɲɔxɔ lu kasorasane xɔn, a xa liga alo ɛ birin nan kasoon na. Ɛ ɲɔxɔ lu muxu ɲaxankataxine xɔn, a xa liga alo ɛ birin nan tɔrɔxi.<verse eid="HEB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4"/>Muxun birin xa futun binya, yalunyaan nama a xɔsi. Ala yanga suxune nun yalundene kitima nɛn.<verse eid="HEB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5"/>Ɛ dunuɲa yi gidin nama findi gbeti xɔnxɔnna ra. Seen naxan ɛ yii, na xa ɛ wasa amasɔtɔ Ala bata a fala, a naxa, “N mi kelɛ i dɛxɔn mumɛ, n mi ɛ rabeɲinɲɛ fefe ma.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">13.5</char> A mato Sariyane 31.6 nun 31.8 nun Yosuwe 1.5 kui.</note> <verse eid="HEB 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6"/>Nayi, en xa xaxili ragidi fa fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">“Marigin nan n mali muxun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">n mi gaxun sese yɛɛ ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">Adamadiin nɔɛ nanfe ligɛ n na?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">13.6</char> Yaburin 118.6</note><verse eid="HEB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7"/>Ɛ xaxili lu ɛ yɛɛrati singene xɔn, naxanye Alaa falan ti ɛ xa. Ɛ miri e dunuɲa raɲanna kiin ma, ɛ yi e raliga e dɛnkɛlɛyani. <verse eid="HEB 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8"/>Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin yi kii naxan yi xoro, a mɔn na kii nin to, a luma na kii nin habadan. <verse eid="HEB 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9"/>Ɛ nama tin xaran xɔɲɛ sifa yo ma naxan ɛ ratantanma. Amasɔtɔ a lan en niin xa sɛnbɛn sɔtɔ Alaa hinanni, koni don seene yamarine fe mi a ra, naxanye tɔnɔ mi na.<verse eid="HEB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10"/>Saraxa gandena nde en tan yii, Ala Batu Bubuna saraxaraline mi daxa e yi na saraxa seen don.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">13.10</char> Na findixi ariyanna gbeen nan na, Yesu soxi dɛnaxan yi. A mato Heburune 9.11-14 kui.</note> <verse eid="HEB 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11"/>Amasɔtɔ saraxarali kuntigin suben naxan ba yulubi xafari saraxan na, a ne wunla xalima yire sariɲanxi fisamantenna nin. Koni e gbindin tan ganma yamaan daaxaden fari ma nɛn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">13.11</char> A mato Saraxaraline 16.27 kui.</note> <verse eid="HEB 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12"/>Nanara, Yesu fan faxa taan xanbi ra, alogo a xa yamaan nasariɲan a yɛtɛɛn wunla xɔn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">13.12</char> A mato Yoni 19.17-20 kui.</note> <verse eid="HEB 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13"/>Nayi, en siga a fɔxɔ ra yamaan dɔxɔden fari ma, en sa a yagin ɲɔxɔnna sɔtɔ. <verse eid="HEB 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14"/>Amasɔtɔ taa mi en yii dunuɲani ito yi naxan buyɛ. Taan naxan fama, en na nan fenma. <verse eid="HEB 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15"/>Nayi, en ma tantunna xa findi saraxan na naxan nalima Ala ma waxatin birin, en yi lu en tiyɛ a xinla ra. <verse eid="HEB 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16"/>Ɛ nama ɲinan ɛ fe faɲin naba, ɛ yi ɛ bode mali ngaxakedenyani, amasɔtɔ na saraxa sifan nan nafan Ala ma.<verse eid="HEB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17"/>Ɛ ɛ yɛɛratine fala xuiin suxu ɛ xuru e sariyan bun. Amasɔtɔ e ɛ niin nakantanma, bayo e fan e dɛntɛgɛma nɛn. Nayi, ɛ liga e xa wanla kɛ sɛwani benun a xa e tɔrɔ, bayo na tɔnɔ mi ɛ tan ma.<verse eid="HEB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18"/>Ɛ lu Ala maxandɛ nxu xa. Amasɔtɔ nxu laxi a ra a nxu bata xaxili sɔtɔ, e nun nxu waxi a xɔn ma nxu xa sigan ti fe faɲin nin. <verse eid="HEB 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19"/>N na ɛ mafanma ɛ Ala maxandi alogo n xa xɛtɛ ɛ ma mafurɛn!<verse eid="HEB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dubana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20"/>Bɔɲɛ xunbenla Ala, naxan en Marigi Yesu rakeli sayani habadan layirin xidi wunla barakani, Yesu naxan a ɲɔxɔ luma en xɔn alo xuruse rabana, <verse eid="HEB 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21"/>na Ala xa fe faɲin birin fi ɛ ma, alogo ɛ nɔ a sagoon ligɛ, naxan a kɛnɛnɲɛ. Ala xa na liga Alaa Muxu Sugandixin Yesu xɔn, binyen fiin naxan ma habadan. Amina.<verse eid="HEB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fala dɔnxɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22"/>Ngaxakedenne, n na ɛ mafanma, ɛ tuli mati maxadi falani ito ra diɲani amasɔtɔ n kɛdin naxan sɛbɛxi ɛ ma ito ra, a mi gbo. <verse eid="HEB 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23"/>Ɛ xa a kolon a en ngaxakedenna Timɔte bata mini kasoon na. Xa a fa sinma, nxu birin fɛ ɛ fɛma.<verse eid="HEB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24"/>Nxu xa ɛ yɛɛratine nun ɛ yama sariɲanxin birin xɔntɔn. Itali kaane fan ɛ xɔntɔn.<verse eid="HEB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25"/>Ala xa hinan ɛ birin na.<verse eid="HEB 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13"/>
</usx>
